{
  "name": "Summarize competitors' Google, Meta, and B2B ads weekly with LeadMagic and AI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Competitor ad intelligence digest\n\n### How it works\n1. Every Monday, collects each competitor's current Google, Meta, and B2B ads.\n2. An AI model summarizes themes, offers, and changes across competitors.\n3. The summary is posted to Slack.\n\n### Setup\n1. List competitor domains in **Competitors**.\n2. Select an Anthropic credential in **Claude** (or swap in any chat model).\n3. Pick a Slack channel.\n4. Select your LeadMagic credential in the three ad nodes.\n\n### Customization\nAds are charged per ad returned. **Max Ads** is set to 10 per network; raise it for deeper research.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "2243a3d1-d8bd-5612-aa6b-af1434de2ff9",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "66e2d9ba-8055-51fb-9b50-5375a3a9f43c",
      "name": "Every Monday",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"competitors\": [\"example.com\", \"example.org\"]\n}\n",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2500524e-fadc-5160-a882-8d1c86156920",
      "name": "Competitors",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
